//@ run-pass
//@ requires: madaros
//@ expect-stdout: LLM_PHASE10_CONFORMAL_Q8_PASS
//
// Phase 10 Step 2-Native: Conformal Q8 Verification
// Test 1: qwen3_gemv_q8_fast CPU vs Metal parity on aligned (in_dim=128) and tail (in_dim=40) paths.
// Test 2: qwen3_vec_add_accum_norm (reset_flag=1 and reset_flag=0) CPU vs Metal parity.
// Test 3: qwen3_compute_row_scale (f32 & bf16) + qwen3_gemv_q8_conformal_head + certify_global parity
//         in both certified (q=1.291984) and uncertified (q=200.0) regimes.
// Test 4: Conformal q_threshold constants (modes 7..10) + real Qwen3-0.6B certified & fallback step check.

